				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "MicroPrints provide a pixel-based representation of text files or source code enriched with semantical information. They can help understanding of software systems [Robbes, Ducasse & Lanza](https://scg.unibe.ch/archive/papers/Robb05b-microprintsESUG.pdf)\n\nAssuming I have a git code repository, I can initialize the visualizer with that repo:\n"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
